{"id":"naoborot","lemma":"наоборот","pos":"adv","rank":1045,"glosses":["inside out, back to front","vice versa, the other way round, conversely","on the contrary, to the contrary"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/6d/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%BE%D0%B1%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%BE%D1%82.ogg/Ru-%D0%BD%D0%B0%D0%BE%D0%B1%D0%BE%D1%80%D0%BE%D1%82.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Посмотри, что делают все, и сделай наоборот.","en":"Watch what everyone does and do the opposite.","words":[{"g":"to look","l":"посмотреть"},{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"делать"},{"g":"everyone, everybody"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"сделать"},null]},{"text":"Наоборот, я никогда такого не говорил.","en":"On the contrary, I've never said such a thing.","words":[null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"never, nevermore"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to speak, to talk","l":"говорить"}]},{"text":"Обычно бывает наоборот.","en":"It's usually the other way around.","words":[{"g":"usually"},{"g":"to be","l":"бывать"},null]},{"text":"Он сделал всё наоборот.","en":"He did the opposite.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"сделать"},{"g":"everything, all"},null]},{"text":"Том сделал это наоборот.","en":"Tom did it backwards.","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"сделать"},{"g":"this / it is"},null]}]}